{
  "about": "The preferences a device keeps with the account (spec/sync-protocol.md, Preferences): a key each, its value the part of the device's settings it names, as the message messages names for the key (proto/pochical/v1/preferences.proto), written here in its JSON form. defaults is what each key holds on a device where nothing was set yet, every key the account keeps. Each of roundTrips is one value of its key a device takes from the account and then holds for that key again, the other keys left as they were. Each of unreadable is a value a device cannot take (a name it has none of, or a number out of its range), or a key it has none of, which leaves a device holding the values of roundTrips as it was. Each of markLookToSend is the account's look (only its style and fill matter; null while the account keeps none) and the shape the account last said the user's marks are drawn in (Profile's mark_look; null before any device sent one), and what a device sends with SetMarkLook then, null for nothing (spec/sync-protocol.md, Profile).",
